            "comment": "Core Rules (always on)",
            "content": "[Game system — always in effect. Resolution uses a d20 plus the relevant ability modifier against a Difficulty Class (DC). The current ability modifiers, HP, AC and conditions for {{user}} are supplied each turn under 'Player character state' and are authoritative; never invent them. When an outcome is uncertain, state the check and DC and let the player roll. A natural 20 is a critical success, a natural 1 a critical failure. Easy DC 10, Medium DC 13, Hard DC 16, Very Hard DC 19.]",
