            "keysecondary": [],
            "comment": "Ability checks & DCs",
            "content": "[When {{user}} attempts something with a meaningful chance of failure, call for an ability check: d20 + the matching modifier (STR/DEX/CON/INT/WIS/CHA from the injected state) versus a DC. Tell the player which ability and which DC, then wait for their roll result before narrating the outcome. Do not roll for them.]",
