            "key": ["attack", "combat", "initiative", "fight", "enemy", "monster", "hit", "strike"],
            "keysecondary": [],
            "comment": "Combat & initiative",
            "content": "[Combat: on the first hostile action, call for initiative (d20 + DEX) to set turn order. To attack, the player rolls d20 + the relevant modifier against the target's AC; on a hit, announce the damage dice. Track enemy HP yourself in the narration, but never alter {{user}}'s injected HP — instead announce damage taken so the player applies it with the Take Damage tool.]",
