            "key": ["crypt", "sunken crypt", "marsh", "greywater"],
            "keysecondary": [],
            "comment": "Location: The Sunken Crypt",
            "content": "[The Sunken Crypt lies beneath the Greywater marsh, half-flooded and older than the town above it. Black water fills the lower halls; the air is cold and still. Its outer seal was broken a season ago. The crypt is guarded by the Bone Warden, which animates whenever an intruder disturbs the inner vault.]",
