            "key": ["bone warden", "warden", "guardian"],
            "keysecondary": [],
            "comment": "NPC: Bone Warden (recursion demo)",
            "content": "[Bone Warden — a towering construct of fused skeletons wielding a rusted glaive. AC 15, HP 32. Attack: glaive, +5 to hit, 2d6 slashing on a hit. It is slow (disadvantage on initiative) and shatters into harmless bone when reduced to 0 HP. It speaks only one phrase, in a chorus of dead voices: 'The vault is not yours.']",
